{"2895640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gallery of Shadows - Lycans Returns", "steam_appid": 2895640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lycans Returns </strong>is the first game in the<strong> Gallery of Shadows </strong>Universe<strong>, </strong>a <strong>Dark Fantasy </strong>Universe based on classic monsters and other fantastic beings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/805d13d1e451313a218360eb2a878e97.avif?t=1768321808\" width=540 height=540 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/e5e509ab534342ae11cf0bf70e055837.avif?t=1768321808\" width=327 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game you take the role of a &quot;<strong>Lycan</strong>&quot; a Werewolf who comes from &quot;<strong>Lycan Island</strong>&quot; with the mission to recover &quot;<strong>The Southern Lands</strong>&quot; which were territories that his species dominated centuries ago and which are now under the control of humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/686a859bf195355dc14cff98d4bdfb8b.avif?t=1768321808\" width=327 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to recover the 4 areas invaded by humans &quot;<strong>The Farm</strong>, <strong>Altonian</strong>, <strong>Fortoria</strong> and <strong>Poman</strong>&quot; by hunting humans during the night and raising the fear bar of each area to conquer them and thus achieve that the <strong>Lycans</strong> dominate <strong>The Southern Lands</strong> again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/aa11f8a3c04383f7059c8b80b221789f.poster.avif?t=1768321808\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/aa11f8a3c04383f7059c8b80b221789f.webm?t=1768321808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/aa11f8a3c04383f7059c8b80b221789f.mp4?t=1768321808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful, if a human sees you, it won't be long before they become alert and run, and if an <strong>Officer</strong> detects you, they will alert the others and ring the bell to call a <strong>Hunter</strong> who will take you to their dungeons if they manage to capture you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/452ed8e4b9096b35bbd6b6e688ecd090.poster.avif?t=1768321808\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/452ed8e4b9096b35bbd6b6e688ecd090.webm?t=1768321808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/452ed8e4b9096b35bbd6b6e688ecd090.mp4?t=1768321808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>WALK AMONG HUMANS</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the day, you can use your human form to interact with humans and learn about the history surrounding the <strong>Lycan Purge</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/a73d9d40b7e77fd5a6b4c0a6daa73ffd.poster.avif?t=1768321808\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/a73d9d40b7e77fd5a6b4c0a6daa73ffd.webm?t=1768321808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/a73d9d40b7e77fd5a6b4c0a6daa73ffd.mp4?t=1768321808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>MEET OTHER CREATURES</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Gallery of Shadows</strong> universe is full of <strong>Creatures</strong> and <strong>Monsters</strong>, and in <strong>Lycans Returns</strong>, you'll meet some of them who can help you in your mission to reclaim <strong>The Southern Lands</strong> Talk to them and discover their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/f7b81500524d07ba3cf28eda7498c522.poster.avif?t=1768321808\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/f7b81500524d07ba3cf28eda7498c522.webm?t=1768321808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/f7b81500524d07ba3cf28eda7498c522.mp4?t=1768321808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>CUSTOMIZE TO YOUR TASTE</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aside from your main mission, you'll also have a territory at your disposal, which you can upgrade from a <strong>Camp</strong> to a <strong>Mansion</strong>. You can also dress up in a number of <strong>Outfits</strong> that you can earn throughout the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/b5cad709f776c7a5f63cff94a282fbb5.poster.avif?t=1768321808\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/b5cad709f776c7a5f63cff94a282fbb5.webm?t=1768321808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/b5cad709f776c7a5f63cff94a282fbb5.mp4?t=1768321808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/f15a3f56bd9b72a49baf9783a3d7c342.poster.avif?t=1768321808\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/f15a3f56bd9b72a49baf9783a3d7c342.webm?t=1768321808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/f15a3f56bd9b72a49baf9783a3d7c342.mp4?t=1768321808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lycans Returns </strong>is the first game in the<strong> Gallery of Shadows </strong>Universe<strong>, </strong>a <strong>Dark Fantasy </strong>Universe based on classic monsters and other fantastic beings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/805d13d1e451313a218360eb2a878e97.avif?t=1768321808\" width=540 height=540 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/e5e509ab534342ae11cf0bf70e055837.avif?t=1768321808\" width=327 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game you take the role of a &quot;<strong>Lycan</strong>&quot; a Werewolf who comes from &quot;<strong>Lycan Island</strong>&quot; with the mission to recover &quot;<strong>The Southern Lands</strong>&quot; which were territories that his species dominated centuries ago and which are now under the control of humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/686a859bf195355dc14cff98d4bdfb8b.avif?t=1768321808\" width=327 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to recover the 4 areas invaded by humans &quot;<strong>The Farm</strong>, <strong>Altonian</strong>, <strong>Fortoria</strong> and <strong>Poman</strong>&quot; by hunting humans during the night and raising the fear bar of each area to conquer them and thus achieve that the <strong>Lycans</strong> dominate <strong>The Southern Lands</strong> again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/aa11f8a3c04383f7059c8b80b221789f.poster.avif?t=1768321808\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/aa11f8a3c04383f7059c8b80b221789f.webm?t=1768321808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/aa11f8a3c04383f7059c8b80b221789f.mp4?t=1768321808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful, if a human sees you, it won't be long before they become alert and run, and if an <strong>Officer</strong> detects you, they will alert the others and ring the bell to call a <strong>Hunter</strong> who will take you to their dungeons if they manage to capture you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/452ed8e4b9096b35bbd6b6e688ecd090.poster.avif?t=1768321808\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/452ed8e4b9096b35bbd6b6e688ecd090.webm?t=1768321808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/452ed8e4b9096b35bbd6b6e688ecd090.mp4?t=1768321808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>WALK AMONG HUMANS</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the day, you can use your human form to interact with humans and learn about the history surrounding the <strong>Lycan Purge</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/a73d9d40b7e77fd5a6b4c0a6daa73ffd.poster