=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/b5cad709f776c7a5f63cff94a282fbb5.poster.avif?t=1768321808\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/b5cad709f776c7a5f63cff94a282fbb5.webm?t=1768321808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/b5cad709f776c7a5f63cff94a282fbb5.mp4?t=1768321808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/f15a3f56bd9b72a49baf9783a3d7c342.poster.avif?t=1768321808\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/f15a3f56bd9b72a49baf9783a3d7c342.webm?t=1768321808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/extras/f15a3f56bd9b72a49baf9783a3d7c342.mp4?t=1768321808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Gallery of Shadows Lycans Returns is a Hunting and Stealth game where you must hunt humans to instill fear and recover the lost Territories of the Werewolves or &quot;Lycans&quot;.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Latin America, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/3799a62413789b056dd3f1950bbf27434ea7e3f2/header.jpg?t=1768321808", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895640/36da7b8a265e74d62e47a87ad97a7342778b06c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768321808", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.